        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, the plaintiff appeals from an order of the Supreme Court, Nassau County (Mahon, J), dated February 29, 2012, which granted the motion of the defendants Hariri Realty Associates, Inc., and Jen-Kev Management, LLC, for summary judgment dismissing the complaint insofar as asserted against them.",
